{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:bb3f24020ad7d391","name":"Cloaked","source":{"id":"source:reference-bb3f24020ad7d391","title":"Cloaked","revision":19625,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:18:42Z","sha256":"238d7e00b7e5072ad665b5310cd8929801a2d45682a372a33fcece12ac90782f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19625","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Cloaked&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-bb3f24020ad7d391","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 750\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Cloaked Equipment has its energy signatures baffled, any noises it makes muffled, its appearance camouflaged and slenderized, and it comes with a case that allows it to be placed in an inconspicuous location. When not in use, such ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," imposes a -5 penalty on any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check made to detect it. When in use, it imposes only a -2 penalty on such checks.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapons"}," are obvious when in use, even if Cloaked. Cloaked ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," does not help with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sneak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sneak"},", but it applies when you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check to produce a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deceptive Appearance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance"}," (such as making the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," appear as ordinary clothing).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
